  "notes": "Romagna lowland/hill kit: stucco houses in ochre, cream, salmon and Pompeian red with green persiane and coppi roofs; red-brick churches and farmhouses (case coloniche); stone pines along the Cervia pinewood and promenade; Lombardy poplars along canals; cypresses at villas and cemeteries; Sangiovese vineyards and peach orchards; salt pans with reeds and flamingos. Signs follow the Italian Codice della Strada shapes (generic, no brand marks).",
